  "result": "The two decisions live in three places:\n\n- **Which organizations are due:** `shouldRunForOrg` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts`. It skips archived orgs and matches the current UTC hour against `org.settings.digestHourUtc`. `runDigestEmailJob` in the same file applies it on each tick, along with the `digest_email` feature flag. The cron route `src/app/api/cron/digest/route.ts` only triggers the job.\n- **Who is on the list:** `listDigestRecipients` in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts` delegates to `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`. That query selects users in the org whose `digestOnly` preference is true.\n\nANSWER: src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts, src/server/services/digest-service.ts, src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts",
